# Field Agent Mobile Flow (SR-App)

Detailed reference: `docs/steering/domain/field-agent-mobile-flow.md`. Phone, one-handed, gloves, bad
signal, cold.

**Priority actions (≤2 taps from a job):** (1) job essentials + "navigate", (2) advance status
EN_ROUTE→IN_PROGRESS→COMPLETED, (3) one-tap time start/stop, (4) add note/photo (camera-first),
(5) build/finalize invoice + record payment (own job).

**Hard rules**
- Mobile-first, thumb-reachable primary actions (bottom-anchored, large targets); **no multi-step wizards** on the critical path.
- **Bad-signal tolerant:** reads use cached assigned-job data offline; supported offline writes (status, note, photo, time start/stop) queue + sync with visible pending state. **Never lose a queued write silently.**
- Never block the agent on a spinner for non-critical calls; optimistic UI with sync status where safe.
- Field agents only ever see **their own** jobs.
- **"Navigate"** opens the device's native maps app to the location coords — no in-app turn-by-turn.

**Guidance:** one scrollable Job Detail with a sticky action bar; default to today's assigned jobs; show "X changes pending sync" when offline writes queued.

**DoD:** assigned → en route → in progress → completed → invoiced → paid all doable on phone, priority actions ≤2 taps, offline reads work, offline write set queues+syncs visibly, no critical action needs a wizard.
